<para>WAL segments beyond confirmed_lsn will be retained until the slot is resumed or dropped. Returns false if the slot is already paused or has been dropped.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>True when the operation succeeds.</para>
</simplesect>
This ensures lock-free blocking operations and prevents deadlocks. </para>
